---
/*
  Tuned's editor, rebuilt from the product's own primitives rather than
  photographed: the window chrome, the rail, the document rows with their
  word-level diff, the match pill, the page thumbnails and the fitting bar.

  Deliberately not a picture of the Tuned landing page — a landing inside a
  landing says nothing, and this page links to the real one a line below.

  The window is a promise, not an illustration: whoever signs in should find
  this screen. So every colour, radius and control inside it is the app's own
  (dark theme), never the site's around it.
*/
---

<div class="win" aria-hidden="true" data-scene data-dur="1600">
  <div class="bar">
    <span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    <span class="wtitle">Tuned<i class="sep"></i>Stripe<i class="sep"></i>Senior Platform Engineer</span>
    <span class="tag">sample</span>
  </div>

  <div class="app">
    <div class="rail">
      <span class="item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h8l4 4v14H6zM14 3v4h4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        Base CV<b>24</b>
      </span>
      <span class="item on">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4v9a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h7M7 20a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4M7 8a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4M18 18a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
        Variants<b class="acc">1</b>
      </span>
      <span class="sub">Stripe</span>
      <span class="item">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4-3 7-7 9-4-2-7-5-7-9V6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        Check
      </span>
      <span class="me"><i>EZ</i>Evgenii Z.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="editor">
      <div class="ed-head">
        <div>
          <p class="crumb">Variants<i class="sep"></i>Stripe</p>
          <p class="ed-title">Senior Platform Engineer, Payments</p>
        </div>
        <span class="match">Match <b data-count="92" data-decimals="0">92</b></span>
      </div>

      <div class="tabs"><span class="on">Resume</span><span>Letter</span><span>Posting</span></div>

      <div class="doc">
        <p class="sec">EXPERIENCE</p>
        <div class="row pos">
          <span class="tg"></span>
          <span class="pn">Gift Fight<em> · Platform &amp; Full Stack Engineer</em></span>
          <span class="pm">2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row bl lit">
          <span class="tg"></span>
          <span>Architected multi-step rounds as durable Temporal workflows<mark class="d1">, reaching 99.5% completion through deterministic retries and idempotent handlers</mark>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row bl">
          <span class="tg"></span>
          <span>Held p95 state-sync latency at 120 ms over a Socket.IO gameplay layer<mark class="d2">, measured with 300 concurrent sessions</mark>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row bl cut">
          <span class="tg"></span>
          <span><s>Animated the game loop with Motion and Lottie inside the Telegram WebView.</s><em>kept in base</em></span>
        </div>
        <p class="sec">SKILLS</p>
        <div class="skills">
          <span class="s">Kubernetes</span><span class="s">PostgreSQL</span><span class="s">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="s add a1">+ idempotency</span><span class="s add a2">+ PCI scope</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="preview">
      <div class="pv-top"><span>Preview</span><span class="mono">2 pages</span></div>
      <div class="pages">
        <span class="paper">
          <i style="left: 12%; top: 7%; width: 44%; height: 3.2%; background: #1f232b"></i>
          <i style="left: 12%; top: 13%; width: 62%; height: 1.4%; background: #8a919e"></i>
          <i style="left: 12%; top: 22%; width: 24%; height: 1.4%; background: #5561d6"></i>
          <i class="lines" style="left: 12%; top: 27%; right: 12%; height: 22%; --pitch: 7%; --gap: 18%"></i>
          <i style="left: 12%; top: 56%; width: 20%; height: 1.4%; background: #5561d6"></i>
          <i class="lines" style="left: 12%; top: 61%; right: 12%; height: 16%; --pitch: 9%; --gap: 24%"></i>
        </span>
        <span class="paper second">
          <i style="left: 12%; top: 8%; width: 24%; height: 1.4%; background: #5561d6"></i>
          <i class="lines" style="left: 12%; top: 13%; right: 12%; height: 30%; --pitch: 6%; --gap: 15%"></i>
          <i style="left: 12%; top: 52%; width: 20%; height: 1.4%; background: #5561d6"></i>
          <i class="lines" style="left: 12%; top: 57%; right: 12%; height: 14%; --pitch: 9%; --gap: 24%"></i>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="fit"><span class="track"><i></i></span><span class="mono">7 lines</span></div>
      <span class="dl">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 4v11m0 0 4.5-4.5M12 15l-4.5-4.5M5 19h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        Download PDF
      </span>
      <p class="fine">Page fitting is measured against a real PDF renderer, not estimated.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .win {
    width: 660px;
    height: 532px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0f1116;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: var(--sh-mock);
    /* The app's dark-theme accent, oklch(0.694 0.186 264.5). */
    --app-acc: #6f95ff;
    --app-acc-soft: rgba(111, 149, 255, 0.16);
    /* The page sets tabular figures on everything; the app keeps them for
       numbers that stand in a column or change in place. */
    font-variant-numeric: normal;
  }

  .bar {
    flex: none;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    background: #0b0d11;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a1a7b3;
  }

  .dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .dots i {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
  }

  .wtitle {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0 9px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .app {
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .rail {
    width: 152px;
    flex: none;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 12px 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #a1a7b3;
  }

  .item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .item svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .item.on {
    background: var(--app-acc-soft);
    color: #f2f4f8;
  }

  .item.on svg {
    color: var(--app-acc);
  }

  .item b {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  .item b.acc {
    color: var(--app-acc);
  }

  .rail .sub {
    padding: 3px 9px 7px 31px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  .me {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .me i {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    /* The avatar has a warm pair of its own, not an accent wash. */
    background: oklch(0.3697 0.0613 47.4);
    color: oklch(0.8715 0.0779 51.9);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .editor {
    flex-grow: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ed-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .crumb {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #7c828e;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .ed-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f2f4f8;
  }

  .match {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.36);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a1a7b3;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .match b {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    /* 400: the mono face ships one weight, and a second file for this number
       alone was 15 KB. */
    font-weight: 400;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: #4ade9b;
  }

  /*
    The app's tabs are labels over a hairline, the active one marked by an
    accent rule laid over that hairline rather than by a fill.
  */
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 12px 0 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .tabs span {
    position: relative;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 5px 0;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  .tabs .on {
    color: #f2f4f8;
  }

  .tabs .on::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 -1px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--app-acc);
  }

  .doc {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 19px;
    color: #a1a7b3;
  }

  .sec {
    margin: 8px 0 2px;
    padding-left: 8px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .row.lit {
    background: rgba(111, 149, 255, 0.07);
  }

  /*
    A node switched off stays in the document, struck through and muted, the
    way the app shows it; fading the whole row instead melts the text into a
    grey smear. The switch flips during the scene, so `--k` runs 0 to 1.
  */
  .row.cut {
    --k: clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.3) * 5, 1);
    opacity: calc(1 - 0.3 * var(--k));
  }

  .row.cut s {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, #7c828e calc(var(--k) * 100%), transparent);
    color: color-mix(in srgb, #7c828e calc(var(--k) * 100%), #a1a7b3);
  }

  .row.cut em {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  /*
    Every node carries the app's switch: it means "show this in the document",
    not "tick this off a list". Scaled down from the app's 30 x 18 for the
    mock's density, keeping its proportions: twice as long as tall, the knob
    four short of the height.
  */
  .tg {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    width: 24px;
    height: 13px;
    margin-top: 3px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--app-acc);
  }

  .tg::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    left: 2px;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    /* The dark theme's knob. */
    background: oklch(0.957 0.005 260);
    transform: translateX(11px);
  }

  /* Off: the dark theme's strong track, knob to the left. */
  .cut .tg {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--app-acc) calc((1 - var(--k)) * 100%), oklch(0.366 0.013 260));
  }

  .cut .tg::after {
    transform: translateX(calc((1 - var(--k)) * 11px));
  }

  .pn {
    color: #f2f4f8;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pn em {
    color: #a1a7b3;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .pm {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #7c828e;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /*
    The rewrite writes itself in: each highlighted run wipes from left to right
    as the scene runs, one after the other, which is what the editor's own diff
    does when a variant is generated.
  */
  mark {
    color: #4ade9b;
    background-color: transparent;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.16), rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.16)),
      linear-gradient(rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.5), rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.5));
    background-size:
      var(--w, 100%) 100%,
      var(--w, 100%) 1px;
    background-position:
      0 0,
      0 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  .d1 {
    --w: calc(clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.15) * 3, 1) * 100%);
  }

  .d2 {
    --w: calc(clamp(0, (var(--p) - 0.4) * 3, 1) * 100%);
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 0 8px;
  }

  /* The app's one chip. */
  .s {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 26px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    color: #a1a7b3;
  }

  .s.add {
    border-color: rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.36);
    background: rgba(74, 222, 155, 0.1);
    color: #4ade9b;
  }

  .a1 {
    opacity: calc((var(--p) - 0.62) * 6);
  }

  .a2 {
    opacity: calc((var(--p) - 0.72) * 6);
  }

  .preview {
    width: 156px;
    flex: none;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .pv-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  /* The page's `.mono` sets tabular figures; a page count is read, not
     compared in a column. */
  .pv-top .mono {
    font-variant-numeric: normal;
  }

  .pages {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .paper {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    aspect-ratio: 210 / 297;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #eceef3;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* The second page only exists once the rewrite has spilled onto it. */
  .paper.second {
    opacity: calc((var(--p) - 0.55) * 4);
  }

  .paper i {
    position: absolute;
  }

  .paper .lines {
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(#b9bfca 0 var(--pitch), transparent var(--pitch) var(--gap));
  }

  .fit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .track {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .track i {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: calc(76% * var(--p));
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #4ade9b;
  }

  .fit .mono {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  .dl {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    /* The app's primary button is filled with the accent, and in the dark
       theme its label is dark: white on this blue is about 2.8:1. */
    background: var(--app-acc);
    color: oklch(0.15 0.009 260);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .dl svg {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
  }

  .fine {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #7c828e;
  }

  .sep {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.55;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-inline: 8px;
  }
</style>
